{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "imapi",
    "version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "HTTPS IMAP/SMTP gateway. A single POST / operation dispatches seven JSON actions. All three security credentials are required together on every API request. No client-selected mail host. The public static OpenAPI document contains no secrets and performs no mail operations. No automatic send retries or idempotency keys. Default limits: 60 requests/minute/IP network, 20 MiB JSON, 12 MiB MIME, 32 MiB body enrichment per listing; deployment config can override sizes. PHP validates string limits in UTF-8 bytes. Proxy/hosting errors may be non-JSON.",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT",
      "url": "https://github.com/nidan21btc/imapi/blob/main/LICENSE"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://imapi.sann.gmbh",
      "description": "Production"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://imapi.test",
      "description": "Local development; local DNS and trusted development certificate required"
    }
  ],
  "externalDocs": {
    "description": "Setup, configuration and bot guidance",
    "url": "https://github.com/nidan21btc/imapi/blob/main/README.md"
  },
  "security": [
    {
      "BearerAuth": [],
      "MailUser": [],
      "MailPassword": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "invokeMailAction",
        "summary": "Read and manage mail or send a message",
        "description": "Select action in the JSON body; there are no /send, /list or /folders routes. Read operations use PEEK by default. Writes require the caller to decide whether they are appropriate. Do not retry send automatically after a timeout or smtp_status_unknown. On confirmed SMTP acceptance, sent=true remains true even if APPEND or a later completion step fails.",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FoldersRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateFolderRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ListRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GetRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AttachmentRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SendRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FlagRequest"
                  }
                ],
                "discriminator": {
                  "propertyName": "action",
                  "mapping": {
                    "folders": "#/components/schemas/FoldersRequest",
                    "create_folder": "#/components/schemas/CreateFolderRequest",
                    "list": "#/components/schemas/ListRequest",
                    "get": "#/components/schemas/GetRequest",
                    "attachment": "#/components/schemas/AttachmentRequest",
                    "send": "#/components/schemas/SendRequest",
                    "flag": "#/components/schemas/FlagRequest"
                  }
                }
              },
              "examples": {
                "folders": {
                  "value": {
                    "action": "folders"
                  }
                },
                "create_folder": {
                  "value": {
                    "action": "create_folder",
                    "folder": "Archiv/2026"
                  }
                },
                "list": {
                  "value": {
                    "action": "list",
                    "folder": "INBOX",
                    "limit": 20,
                    "since": "2026-11-01",
                    "unseen_only": true
                  }
                },
                "get": {
                  "value": {
                    "action": "get",
                    "folder": "INBOX",
                    "uid": 123,
                    "mark_seen": false
                  }
                },
                "attachment": {
                  "value": {
                    "action": "attachment",
                    "folder": "INBOX",
                    "uid": 123,
                    "index": 0
                  }
                },
                "send": {
                  "value": {
                    "action": "send",
                    "to": [
                      "recipient@sann.gmbh"
                    ],
                    "subject": "Hello",
                    "text": "Hello!",
                    "sent_folder": null
                  }
                },
                "flag": {
                  "value": {
                    "action": "flag",
                    "folder": "INBOX",
                    "uid": 123,
                    "seen": true
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Success. SMTP acceptance stays successful even if saving to Sent fails. Match data to the requested action.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "oneOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FoldersResponse"
                    },
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateFolderResponse"
                    },
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ListResponse"
                    },
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GetResponse"
                    },
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AttachmentResponse"
                    },
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SendResponse"
                    },
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FlagResponse"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "folders": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "data": {
                        "folders": [
                          {
                            "path": "INBOX",
                            "name": "INBOX",
                            "selectable": true
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "create_folder": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "data": {
                        "folder": "Archiv.2026",
                        "created": true
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "list": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "data": {
                        "folder": "INBOX",
                        "messages": [
                          {
                            "uid": 124,
                            "date": "2026-11-15 12:00:00 +0100",
                            "from": [
                              {
                                "email": "sender@example.org",
                                "name": "Sender"
                              }
                            ],
                            "to": [
                              {
                                "email": "user@example.org",
                                "name": ""
                              }
                            ],
                            "cc": [],
                            "subject": "Hello",
                            "seen": false,
                            "flagged": false,
                            "size": 13631488,
                            "attachment_count": null,
                            "too_large": true,
                            "body_loaded": false
                          },
                          {
                            "uid": 123,
                            "date": "2026-11-15 12:00:00 +0100",
                            "from": [
                              {
                                "email": "sender@example.org",
                                "name": "Sender"
                              }
                            ],
                            "to": [
                              {
                                "email": "user@example.org",
                                "name": ""
                              }
                            ],
                            "cc": [],
                            "subject": "Hello",
                            "seen": false,
                            "flagged": false,
                            "size": 512,
                            "attachment_count": 0,
                            "too_large": false,
                            "body_loaded": true
                          }
                        ],
                        "truncated": true
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "get": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "data": {
                        "uid": 123,
                        "date": "2026-11-15 12:00:00 +0100",
                        "from": [
                          {
                            "email": "sender@example.org",
                            "name": "Sender"
                          }
                        ],
                        "to": [
                          {
                            "email": "user@example.org",
                            "name": ""
                          }
                        ],
                        "cc": [],
                        "subject": "Hello",
                        "seen": false,
                        "flagged": false,
                        "size": 512,
                        "attachment_count": 0,
                        "headers": "Subject: Hello\r\n\r\n",
                        "text": "Hello",
                        "html": "",
                        "attachments": []
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "attachment": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "data": {
                        "index": 0,
                        "name": "hello.txt",
                        "type": "text/plain",
                        "size": 5,
                        "content_id": null,
                        "disposition": "attachment",
                        "content_base64": "SGVsbG8="
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "send": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "data": {
                        "sent": true,
                        "message_id": "<id@example.org>",
                        "saved_to_sent": false
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "flag": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "data": {
                        "updated": true,
                        "moved_to": null
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "sent_copy_failed": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "data": {
                        "sent": true,
                        "message_id": "<id@example.org>",
                        "saved_to_sent": false,
                        "sent_folder_error": "Ablage im Gesendet-Ordner fehlgeschlagen",
                        "warning": "sent_copy_failed"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "folder_exists": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "data": {
                        "folder": "Gesendet",
                        "created": false
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid JSON/action/parameters. Codes: invalid_json, invalid_action, invalid_parameter.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "invalid_parameter",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid Bearer key. Codes: unauthorized.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "unauthorized",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "WWW-Authenticate": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "description": "Bearer challenge."
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Mailbox forbidden, IMAP/SMTP authentication failed, or at least one to/cc/bcc/reply_to domain is not permitted. recipient_not_allowed rejects the whole send before any mail connection. Codes: mailbox_forbidden, mail_auth_failed, recipient_not_allowed.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "mail_auth_failed": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": false,
                      "error": {
                        "code": "mail_auth_failed",
                        "message": "Mail-Anmeldung fehlgeschlagen."
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "recipient_not_allowed": {
                    "value": {
                      "ok": false,
                      "error": {
                        "code": "recipient_not_allowed",
                        "message": "Empfängerdomain nicht erlaubt: foreign.example; nichts versendet."
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Folder, message or attachment missing. sent_folder_not_found occurs before SMTP; nothing sent. Codes: folder_not_found, message_not_found, attachment_not_found, sent_folder_not_found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "folder_not_found",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "405": {
            "description": "Only POST is accepted by the API. Codes: method_not_allowed.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "method_not_allowed",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Allow": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "POST"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Server does not support safe UID MOVE; no changes made. Codes: move_unsupported.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "move_unsupported",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "Request or full MIME message exceeds configured limits. Header-only list remains available. Codes: request_too_large, message_too_large.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "message_too_large",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "415": {
            "description": "Content-Type must be application/json. Codes: json_required.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "json_required",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "426": {
            "description": "HTTPS required. Never send credentials over HTTP, including redirect attempts. Codes: https_required.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "https_required",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "IP/API/mail-auth limit reached. Respect Retry-After seconds. Codes: rate_limited, mail_auth_rate_limited.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "mail_auth_rate_limited",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                },
                "description": "Seconds until retry; do not automatically retry send if delivery might have happened."
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "Upstream failure. For smtp_status_unknown delivery is uncertain: check before retrying. Flag/move/folder operations may have partially completed. Codes: upstream_error, smtp_failed, smtp_status_unknown, folder_create_failed, folder_subscribe_failed, sent_folder_prepare_failed, fetch_failed, flag_failed, move_failed.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "upstream_error",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Configuration, mail-host whitelist, limiter lock/storage/capacity unavailable. Usually rejected before mail access; a later limiter bookkeeping error can follow a read or mutation. Confirmed SMTP acceptance is never converted to a failed send. Codes: configuration_error, mail_server_forbidden, rate_limit_unavailable, rate_limit_capacity.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "error": {
                    "code": "rate_limit_unavailable",
                    "message": "Anfrage konnte nicht ausgeführt werden."
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                },
                "description": "May be present for limiter lock contention (1 second)."
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "Opaque API key",
        "description": "Authorization: Bearer <API key>. Not JWT. Configured separately from mailbox credentials."
      },
      "MailUser": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Mail-User",
        "description": "Full permitted mailbox email address, max 254 bytes."
      },
      "MailPassword": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Mail-Password",
        "description": "Mailbox password on every API request; nonempty, max 4096 bytes, no CR/LF/NUL. Never log or embed in examples."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "FolderPath": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "UTF-8 folder path, at most 1024 UTF-8 bytes; use the exact path from folders. No control characters.",
        "maxLength": 1024
      },
      "UID": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 1,
        "maximum": 4294967295,
        "description": "UID within a folder and its current UIDVALIDITY. Re-list after a move or mailbox reset."
      },
      "Email": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Bare email address without display name, at most 254 input and normalized bytes. IDN domains are normalized to lowercase UTS-46 nontransitional ASCII/Punycode; Unicode local parts are not supported.",
        "format": "email",
        "maxLength": 254
      },
      "Recipients": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Email"
          },
          {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Email"
            },
            "maxItems": 50
          }
        ],
        "description": "One bare address or a list of at most 50 addresses. For to, the list must not be empty."
      },
      "UploadAttachment": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Nonempty filename, at most 255 UTF-8 bytes; no control characters, / or backslash.",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 255
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "MIME type; defaults to application/octet-stream.",
            "default": "application/octet-stream",
            "maxLength": 127
          },
          "content_base64": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Canonical Base64, no whitespace or line breaks. Decoded data and final MIME message must fit configured limits.",
            "format": "byte"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "name",
          "content_base64"
        ]
      },
      "FoldersRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "folders"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action"
        ],
        "description": "List folders. Read only."
      },
      "CreateFolderRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "create_folder"
            ]
          },
          "folder": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FolderPath"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action",
          "folder"
        ],
        "description": "Create and subscribe, or subscribe an existing folder and return created=false. Portable / hierarchy is translated to the native delimiter. Reject empty names/segments, . and .. segments, control characters, invalid UTF-8, surrounding whitespace, backslashes, wildcards *, %, quotes, leading # and mixed delimiters. Never deletes or renames folders. A failed subscription may leave the folder created; repeating is safe."
      },
      "ListRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "list"
            ]
          },
          "folder": {
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FolderPath"
              }
            ],
            "default": "INBOX"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 100,
            "default": 20
          },
          "since": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Inclusive server calendar date YYYY-MM-DD, or empty string for no filter.",
            "pattern": "^(?:\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})?$",
            "default": ""
          },
          "unseen_only": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action"
        ],
        "description": "Newest UID first, at most limit messages. Header summaries remain visible when bodies exceed size budgets. PEEK does not change Seen. There is no offset/cursor pagination; truncated refers to body enrichment, not additional pages."
      },
      "GetRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "get"
            ]
          },
          "folder": {
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FolderPath"
              }
            ],
            "default": "INBOX"
          },
          "uid": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UID"
          },
          "mark_seen": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action",
          "uid"
        ],
        "description": "Read one message with decoded UTF-8 text/HTML and attachment metadata. Only mark_seen=true changes Seen. Treat HTML and attachment contents as untrusted."
      },
      "AttachmentRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "attachment"
            ]
          },
          "folder": {
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FolderPath"
              }
            ],
            "default": "INBOX"
          },
          "uid": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UID"
          },
          "index": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 10000
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action",
          "uid",
          "index"
        ],
        "description": "Download one zero-based attachment, including inline attachments, as Base64. Does not mark the message as read."
      },
      "SendRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "send"
            ]
          },
          "to": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Email"
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Email"
                },
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 50
              }
            ]
          },
          "cc": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Recipients"
          },
          "bcc": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Recipients"
          },
          "reply_to": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Recipients"
          },
          "subject": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Required, may be empty. No control characters; at most 998 UTF-8 bytes.",
            "maxLength": 998
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Required UTF-8 plain text, may be empty; no NUL. Subject/body/MIME sizes are subject to private configuration."
          },
          "html": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Optional UTF-8 HTML; no NUL. Plain text becomes the alternative body."
          },
          "in_reply_to": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "One Message-ID, including angle brackets; at most 4096 bytes.",
            "maxLength": 4096,
            "example": "<original@example.org>"
          },
          "references": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Space-separated Message-IDs, each including angle brackets; at most 4096 bytes.",
            "maxLength": 4096,
            "example": "<first@example.org> <original@example.org>"
          },
          "attachments": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UploadAttachment"
            },
            "maxItems": 20
          },
          "sent_folder": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Omit to use private config (default Sent). null or empty string skips IMAP entirely. An alternate folder must exist; only the configured folder may be created automatically. At most 1024 UTF-8 bytes. Production uses the exact configured path INBOX.Gesendet; namespace prefixes are not guessed.",
            "nullable": true,
            "maxLength": 1024
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action",
          "to",
          "subject",
          "text"
        ],
        "description": "All to, cc, bcc and reply_to domains must be explicitly allowed by private configuration before any IMAP/SMTP connection. Compare exact normalized domain, case-insensitively; subdomains and suffix matches are not automatically allowed. Unicode IDNs and Punycode normalize to the same UTS-46 nontransitional ASCII domain. Any disallowed domain rejects the entire request with HTTP 403 recipient_not_allowed, reporting that domain and sending nothing. A missing/empty effective allowlist blocks sending. Optional per-mailbox lists replace the global list. From/envelope sender are always the authenticated mailbox; Bcc is absent from MIME headers. Before SMTP, prepare the configured Sent folder; failure prevents SMTP. Once SMTP accepts DATA, return ok=true/sent=true even if APPEND fails. Never automatically retry a successful send or smtp_status_unknown. No idempotency key or automatic retries. A partial recipient rejection can yield sent=true with smtp_warning; do not resend the whole message."
      },
      "FlagRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "flag"
            ]
          },
          "folder": {
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FolderPath"
              }
            ],
            "default": "INBOX"
          },
          "uid": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UID"
          },
          "seen": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "flagged": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "move_to": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FolderPath"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action",
          "uid"
        ],
        "description": "Set/clear Seen or Flagged and/or move to an existing different folder. Omitted flags are unchanged. UID MOVE support is checked before changes; no delete endpoint or COPY/DELETE/EXPUNGE fallback. Multiple changes are not atomic; inspect state after an error. Destination UID may change.",
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "required": [
              "seen"
            ]
          },
          {
            "required": [
              "flagged"
            ]
          },
          {
            "required": [
              "move_to"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "Address": {
        "type": "object",
